**Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Cli-One]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**3 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.

